@@ -146,3 +146,7 @@ ## Code and test ownership
 | Shared LS1/LSFG resource resolution and validation; LS1 translation | `mako-backend/src/extraction/`, `mako-cli inspect-dll` |
 | Portable policy and transition coverage | `mako-render/tests/spatial_scaling_policy_tests.cpp`, `mako-render/tests/profile_update_tests.cpp` |
 | GPU quality and runtime evidence | `mako-cli/src/tools/quality.cpp`, private MAKO Gym suites |
+
+## Experimental GFG Frame Fusion patch
+
+The GFG fork can opt in with `GFG_FRAME_FUSION=1` before launch. Only the SDR8 post-Frame-Generation MAKO path prebinds matching sampled private generated images and skips their source-sized input blit. The scaler shader, output blit, WSI order and pixel semantics remain unchanged. Native Resolution, LS1, HDR, unknown images, unsupported formats and failed bindings use the copy-based path. Runtime status distinguishes prepared bindings from recorded work; counters are not GPU-time or power evidence.
